## Performance

### First Use (Model Downloads)
- Vision model: ~350MB
- Audio model: ~360MB
- Caption model: ~990MB
- **Total**: ~1.7GB one-time download

### Runtime Performance

**CPU (typical consumer hardware):**
- Model loading: 5-10 seconds
- Per perception: 5-10 seconds
- Memory: 2-3GB

**GPU (if available):**
- Model loading: 2-3 seconds
- Per perception: < 1 second
- Memory: 3-4GB VRAM

**Optimization tip:** Models load lazily on first use, not at import.

